    },
    "explanation": [
      {
        "kind": "what",
        "body": "Rückwärts denken: Wenn der Durchschnitt von 5 Werten {{t}} ist, muss die **Summe** $5 \\cdot {{t}} = {{= 5*t}}$ sein."
      },
      {
        "kind": "steps",
        "body": "1. Zielsumme: $5 \\cdot {{t}} = {{= 5*t}}$ cm\n2. Bisherige Summe: ${{h1}} + {{h2}} + {{h3}} + {{h4}} = {{= h1+h2+h3+h4}}$ cm\n3. Fünfter Freund: ${{= 5*t}} - {{= h1+h2+h3+h4}} = {{= 5*t - (h1+h2+h3+h4)}}$ cm"
      },
      {
        "kind": "answer",
        "body": "{{= 5*t - (h1+h2+h3+h4)}} cm"
      }
